  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the radius of bigger&nbsp;droplet is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>,&nbsp;then by volume conservation:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math></p><p>Final potential energy:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Initial potential energy:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, change in potential energy,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>"
